Z||000000||FIEROCIOUS||07-08-2000||12:46 AM||||Well I recieved my timeing cover from Ed Parks today I ordered it from him on wednesday. I contacted him via e-Mail as he out of the TEN used Fiero parts people was the only one to reply, well except for Ron, he had the wrong year cover. <BR>I finaly called Ed and he said it was in good condition but had a striped bolt hole and a broken bolt in another!<P>I told him to ship it 60.00 dollars later it arives and.... the broken bolt was a piece of gasket material (good) the striped out hole was a cracked timeing cover! (bad) <BR>So finaly fed up I took both covers to the machine shop they chose Ed's over the one I had. They decided to weld the cover and re-tap a new hole 50.00!<P>Three weeks later 110.00 so far.....<P>to be continued....<BR>||||reg||1
